# Longest Consecutive Sequence

```
arr  = [100, 4, 200, 1, 3, 2]
hs   = { 100, 4, 200, 1, 3, 2 }
res  = 0
```

```
x=100  curr=1  res=1
x=4    skip
x=200  curr=1  res=1
x=1    curr=1 → curr=2 → curr=3 → curr=4  res=4
x=3    skip
x=2    skip

res = 4
```

